// FAQ data
const faqs = [
  {
    question: 'Best platform to sell online courses?',
    answer: '<p>Teachable for most creators especially those just starting out. Excellent free tier intuitive course builder scales well as you grow. For creators wanting an all-in-one business platform with email marketing and sales funnels built in Kajabi is worth the premium price.</p><p>Want zero transaction fees and maximum customization? Thinkific is an excellent choice with a strong free tier.</p>'
  },
  {
    question: 'How much does creating an online course cost?',
    answer: '<p>Start creating courses for zero upfront using free tiers from Teachable Thinkific or Gumroad. Your main costs:</p><p>Course platform zero to one forty-nine monthly.<br/>Video equipment zero using phone or up to five hundred plus for professional setup.<br/>Screen recording software zero to thirty monthly.<br/>Editing software zero to fifty-five monthly.</p><p>Most creators start with under one hundred monthly in tools and scale up as revenue grows. The free tiers are genuinely usable for launching your first course.</p>'
  },
  {
    question: 'Teachable vs Thinkific?',
    answer: '<p>Both are excellent but they serve slightly different needs.</p><p>Pick Teachable if you want the easiest setup built-in payment processing and don\'t mind transaction fees on free and basic plans. Better for beginners.</p><p>Pick Thinkific if you want zero transaction fees more customization options and stronger quiz and assessment features. Better for established creators.</p><p>Thinkific\'s free plan is more generous with unlimited students while Teachable\'s paid plans include more marketing features.</p>'
